          "iast": "ṛtvigbhiḥ upadiṣṭaḥ",
          "devanagari": "ऋत्विग्भिः उपदिष्टः",
          "meaning": "by Vedic scholars, advised",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "ayam puraa vR^ittaH",
          "iast": "ayam purā vṛttaḥ",
          "devanagari": "अयं पुरा वृत्तः",
