      "devanagari": "इत्युक्तास्ते ततो राज्ञा सर्वे ब्राह्मणसत्तमाः\nवक्ष्यन्ति ते महीपालं ब्राह्मणा वेदपारगाः |\nविभाण्डकसुतं राजन् सर्वोपायैरिहानय",
      "iast": "iti uktāḥ te tato rāGYā sarve brāhmaṇa sattamāḥ\nvakśyanti te mahīpālam brāhmaṇā veda pāragāḥ |\nvibhāṇḍaka sutam rājan sarva upāyaiḥ iha ānaya",
      "translation": "\"Thus said by king those scholarly Brahmans and Vedic scholars will say to the king, 'oh, king, son of Sage Vibhaandaka, namely Rishyasringa, is to be fetched by all methods...",
