      "iast": "ānāyya tu mahIpāla ṛśyaśṛñgam susatkṛtam |\nvibhāṇḍaka sutam rājan brāhmaṇam veda pāragam |\nprayaccha kanyām śāntām vai vidhinā susamāhitaḥ",
