      "label": "1.9.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "वक्ष्यन्ति चिंतयित्वा ते तस्योपायांश्च तत्क्षमान् |\nआनेष्यामो वयं विप्रं न च दोषो भविष्यति",
      "iast": "vakśṣyanti cintayitvā te tasya upāyām ca tān kśamān |\nāneṣyāmo vayam vipram na ca doṣo bhaviṣyati",
      "translation": "\"After thinking over they will say as a second thought, and having found a solution with a plan to bring that sage, 'we will fetch that Brahman and also by that no stigma will occur...'",
